    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineChinese.Array.data[0]'
      value: "\u4F60\u6D41\u4E0B\u7684\u8840\uFF0C\u4E5F\u80FD\u6CBB\u6108\u4F60\u2014\u2014\u53EA\u8981\u4F60\u61C2\u5F97\u5982\u4F55\u4F7F\u7528\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineChinese.Array.data[1]'
      value: "\u4F60\u643A\u5E26\u7684\u5723\u7269......\u5B83\u662F\u6D3B\u7684\uFF0C\u800C\u4E14\u9965\u997F\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineChinese.Array.data[2]'
      value: "\u865A\u7A7A\u4E0D\u662F\u7EC8\u70B9\uFF0C\u800C\u662F\u5B50\u5BAB\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[0]'
      value: The blood you spill is the same that can heal you
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[1]'
      value: Dying again doesn't scare you, does it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[2]'
      value: I bless you with herbs and words
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[3]'
      value: The Void is not an end. It is a womb.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[4]'
      value: The artifact you carry... it's alive. And hungry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[5]'
      value: The war you fight began long ago
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[6]'
      value: The war you fight began long before you were born, child.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[7]'
      value: The war you fight began long before you were born, child.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[8]'
      value: The war you fight began long before you were born, child.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[9]'
      value: The war you fight began long before you were born, child.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linePortuguese.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineSpanish.Array.data[0]'
      value: La sangre que derramas es la misma que puede sanarte
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineSpanish.Array.data[1]'
      value: "El Vac\xEDo no es el fin. Es un vientre."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineSpanish.Array.data[2]'
      value: "El artefacto que llevas... est\xE1 vivo. Y hambriento."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineSpanish.Array.data[3]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'lineEnglish.Array.data[10]'
      value: The war you fight began long before you were born, child.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'linePortuguese.Array.data[0]'
      value: "O sangue que derramas \xE9 o mesmo que pode te curar"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'linePortuguese.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Morrer de novo n\xE3o te assusta, n\xE9?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'linePortuguese.Array.data[2]'
      value: Te benzo com erva e palavra
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'linePortuguese.Array.data[3]'
      value: "O Vazio n\xE3o \xE9 fim. \xC9 ventre."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'linePortuguese.Array.data[4]'
      value: "O corpo volta, mas e a f\xE9?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'linePortuguese.Array.data[5]'
      value: "O artefato que carrega... t\xE1 vivo. E faminto."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'linePortuguese.Array.data[6]'
      value: "A guerra que tu enfrenta come\xE7ou antes de voc\xEA nascer, meu filho."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'linePortuguese.Array.data[7]'
      value: "A guerra que tu enfrenta come\xE7ou antes de voc\xEA nascer, meu filho."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6827350408104105066, guid: 09c12eafcf57382438fc83bf04b650f5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'linePortuguese.Array.data[8]'
      value: "A guerra que tu enfrenta come\xE7ou antes de voc\xEA nascer, meu filho."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
